# Raw knowledge base datasets.
#
# These five JSONL files are immutable source data whose SHA-256 digests are
# asserted throughout Stages 11-14 and the retrieval evaluation. They use CRLF
# line endings, and on a machine with core.autocrlf=true Git would otherwise
# strip one byte per line on commit, so a clone on Linux or macOS would receive
# an LF variant whose digests no longer match.
#
# `-text` disables all end-of-line conversion for them: Git stores and checks
# out the bytes verbatim on every platform.
resources/knowledge/**/*.jsonl -text
